# CSE476 configuration.
#
# HOW TO SWITCH LANES: pick ONE block below. Uncomment its lines (remove the
# leading "# ") and fill in the key. Leave the other blocks commented. Set
# PROVIDER to match the block you turned on. That is the whole job.
#
# GOLDEN RULE: every variable must appear ONCE, only in the ONE lane you use.
# If a line is duplicated, the LAST one silently wins. The MODEL line lives
# INSIDE the Foundry block on purpose, so a deployment name can never leak into
# a free lane (that mistake gives a confusing 404).
#
# NEVER commit .env. It is already in .gitignore. Keep it that way.


# =======================================================================
# Pick your lane: groq | local | foundry
# (GitHub Models was retired by GitHub on 30 July 2026 and is gone.)
# =======================================================================
PROVIDER=groq


# ===== LANE 1, Groq. FREE. The course default. =========================
# Uncomment the key line. No MODEL line needed (the lane has a default).
# Get a free key at console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=PASTE_YOUR_GROQ_KEY_HERE
# (no MODEL line: this lane defaults to llama-3.3-70b-versatile)


# ===== LANE 2, Ollama on your own machine. FREE. NO KEY. ===============
# To use: set PROVIDER=local above. Nothing to paste here.
# Install from ollama.com, then:  ollama pull llama3.2
# (no key, no MODEL line: this lane defaults to llama3.2)


# ===== LANE 3, Microsoft Foundry. Needs an Azure subscription. =========
# To use: set PROVIDER=foundry above, then uncomment the THREE lines below.
# ENDPOINT: the base project endpoint from your Foundry project home. Your
#   lanes.py appends /openai/v1/ for you, so do NOT paste a path ending in
#   /responses or /chat/completions.
# KEY: the long secret from the same page. It is NOT a URL. If your key
#   starts with https:// you copied the endpoint by mistake.
# MODEL: for Foundry this MUST be your DEPLOYMENT name (e.g. chat-demo).
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/your-project/openai/v1/
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=PASTE_YOUR_FOUNDRY_KEY_HERE
# MODEL=chat-demo


# ===== RETIRED, GitHub Models. Do not use. =============================
# GitHub retired GitHub Models on 30 July 2026. The inference API now returns
# a 410 error for everyone. If you have PROVIDER=github, switch to groq or
# local above. Kept here only so old .env files make sense.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
